flowchart TD
  A[Observed vehicle event] --> B[Normalize plate and preserve evidence]
  B --> C[Check watchlist and temporal context]
  C --> D{Identity evidence}
  D -->|strong plate| E[ANPR authoritative]
  D -->|partial plate| F[ANPR + appearance + feasibility]
  D -->|no usable plate| G[Appearance review only]
  E --> H{Policy / corroboration}
  F --> H
  G --> I[Possible / REVIEW]
  H -->|qualifies| J[Alert with provenance]
  H -->|does not qualify| I
  J --> K[Operator acknowledge]
  I --> L[Analyst investigate]
  K --> L
  L --> M[Timeline, evidence, route caveat]
  M --> N[Audit action and export report]
